<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 70.7890 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 70.7890 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge fell to 70.7890 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Friday from 70.7796 on Thursday.</p>
<p>				    Nov 15		  Nov 14</p>
<p>    tenge per dollar	  70.7890		 70.7796</p>
<p>    volume ($ million)	     3.895		   1.850</p>
<p>--Almaty newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
